.* PTF: the task menu for fixes.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='PTF'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=PTF HELP=HLPPTF KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Program Temporary Fix
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?LODPTF'.Load a program temporary fix
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?APYPTF'.Apply a program temporary fix
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?CPYPTF'.Copy a program temporary fix
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?RMVPTF'.Remove a program temporary fix
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?DSPPTF'.Display a program temporary fix
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?SNDPTFORD'.Order a program temporary fix
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?INSPTF'.Install a program temporary fix from a list
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?INSPTF LICPGM(*ALL)'.Install program temporary fix package
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD ?CPYPTFCVR'.Copy PTF Cover Letter
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?DSPPTFCVR'.Display PTF Cover Letter
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='CMD ?DLTPTF'.Delete a program temporary fix
:MENUI OPTION=12 ACTION='CMD WRKPTFGRP'.Work with PTF groups
:MENUI OPTION=13 ACTION='CMD ?CPYPTFGRP'.Copy PTF group
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDPTF'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPPTF.Program Temporary Fix - Help
:P.Fixes to the system's code: load them, apply them, take them back off
and see which are in place.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
